# ── MARK LIII — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# NOTE: trailing "# comment" on a pattern line does NOT work in gitignore —
# the pattern silently stops matching. Keep explanations on their own lines.
config/api_keys.json
config/certs/
config/whatsapp_web/
**/token*.json                # Google OAuth tokens (Gmail / Calendar plugins)
**/client_secret*.json        # Google OAuth client secrets
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/

# ── Voice launcher: runtime state + the 68 MB local speech model ─────────────
# (model is fetched on first run — see voice-launcher/voice_launch.py)
voice-launcher/launcher_state.json
voice-launcher/vosk-model-*/

# runtime logs
jlog-*.txt
voice-launcher/launcher_log*.txt

# ── Learned procedures (personal task memory) ────────────────────────────────
memory/procedures.json

# runtime state (never commit)
vlog-*.txt
voice-launcher/current_mic.txt
config/last_update.json
clean_exit.flag
